{
  "info": {
    "name": "StreamTube (Java)",
    "_postman_id": "b1a7e4f0-0000-4000-8000-streamtube0001",
    "description": "Coleção da API StreamTube (Java/Spring Boot). Fluxo: register -> pegar token no Mailpit -> confirm -> login -> initiate upload -> PUT no MinIO -> complete-upload -> info/stream/download.\n\nVariáveis (aba Variables): baseUrl, mailpitUrl, email, password, accessToken, refreshToken, confirmToken, resetToken, videoId, slug, uploadUrl.\n\nA autenticação Bearer é herdada da coleção ({{accessToken}}); requests públicas usam 'No Auth'.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "mailpitUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8025" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "teste@exemplo.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "senha12345" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "confirmToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "resetToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "videoId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "slug", "value": "" },
    { "key": "uploadUrl", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "thumbUploadUrl", "value": "" },
    { "key": "nickname", "value": "" },
    { "key": "commentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otherNickname", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Gera um e-mail único a cada execução (comente para usar um fixo).",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('email', 'teste-' + Date.now() + '@exemplo.com');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                  "console.log('Registrado:', pm.collectionVariables.get('email'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Pegar token de confirmação (Mailpit)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get('email');",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Achou e-mail no Mailpit', () => data.messages && data.messages.length > 0);",
                  "const id = data.messages[0].ID;",
                  "pm.sendRequest(pm.collectionVariables.get('mailpitUrl') + '/api/v1/message/' + id + '/raw', (err, res) => {",
                  "  if (err) { console.error(err); return; }",
                  "  let raw = res.text().replace(/=\\r\\n/g, '').replace(/=\\n/g, '').replace(/=3D/g, '=');",
                  "  const m = raw.match(/token=([A-Za-z0-9._-]+)/);",
                  "  if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('confirmToken', m[1]); console.log('confirmToken set'); }",
                  "  else { console.error('Token não encontrado no corpo do e-mail'); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mailpitUrl}}/api/v1/search?query=to:{{email}}",
              "host": ["{{mailpitUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "search"],
              "query": [{ "key": "query", "value": "to:{{email}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Confirm Email",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.code === 204);"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/confirm-email?token={{confirmToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "confirm-email"],
              "query": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{confirmToken}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', j.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', j.refresh_token);",
                  "console.log('Tokens salvos.');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Me (autenticado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', j.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', j.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Resend confirmation",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-confirmation", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "resend-confirmation"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Reset password (precisa do resetToken do Mailpit)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"novaSenha12345\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Videos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Initiate upload",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('videoId', j.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('slug', j.slug);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uploadUrl', j.uploadUrl);",
                  "console.log('uploadUrl salvo. Agora rode \"2. Upload file (PUT no MinIO)\".');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Meu primeiro vídeo\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 1048576,\n  \"contentType\": \"video/mp4\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Upload file (PUT no MinIO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Upload OK (200/204)', () => [200, 204].includes(pm.response.code));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "file", "file": { "src": "" } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{uploadUrl}}", "host": ["{{uploadUrl}}"] },
            "description": "Selecione o arquivo de vídeo na aba Body -> binary -> Select File. A URL já vem assinada (NÃO use Authorization aqui)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Complete upload",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.code === 204);"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/complete-upload", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}", "complete-upload"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Get info (acompanhar status)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}"] },
            "description": "Repita até status == READY (QUEUED -> PROCESSING -> READY)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Stream (302)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}/stream", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}", "stream"] },
            "description": "Retorna 302 com Location apontando para o MinIO. Cada stream de vídeo PUBLICADO soma 1 em 'views' (sem dedup; preview de rascunho e download não contam). Para VER o 302, desligue 'Automatically follow redirects' em Settings."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Download (302)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}/download", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}", "download"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Editar vídeo (PATCH, dono)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('título atualizado', () => pm.response.json().title === 'Título editado via Postman');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Título editado via Postman\",\n  \"description\": \"Descrição do vídeo\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"visibility\": \"PUBLIC\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}"] },
            "description": "Edição parcial (somente o dono): title, description, categoryId ('GET /categories' preenche {{categoryId}}) e visibility (PUBLIC | UNLISTED). Campos ausentes ficam intactos. Usa {{videoId}} salvo pelo 'Initiate upload'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Publish (dono)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('publishedAt preenchido', () => pm.response.json().publishedAt !== null);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/publish", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}", "publish"] },
            "description": "Publica um rascunho READY (idempotente). 422 se o vídeo ainda não estiver READY. Antes de publicar, o vídeo só é visível para o dono."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Thumbnail custom (initiate)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('thumbUploadUrl', pm.response.json().uploadUrl);",
                  "console.log('thumbUploadUrl salvo. Agora rode \"10. Thumbnail upload (PUT no MinIO)\".');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"sizeBytes\": 102400,\n  \"contentType\": \"image/jpeg\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/thumbnail", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}", "thumbnail"] },
            "description": "Somente image/* e até 5 MiB (THUMB_MAX_SIZE_BYTES). sizeBytes deve ser o tamanho EXATO do arquivo (vai assinado na URL)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Thumbnail upload (PUT no MinIO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Upload OK (200/204)', () => [200, 204].includes(pm.response.code));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "file", "file": { "src": "" } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{thumbUploadUrl}}", "host": ["{{thumbUploadUrl}}"] },
            "description": "Selecione a imagem na aba Body -> binary -> Select File. A URL já vem assinada (NÃO use Authorization aqui)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11. Thumbnail complete",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('thumbnailUrl aponta para -custom', () => pm.response.json().thumbnailUrl.includes('-custom'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/thumbnail/complete", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}", "thumbnail", "complete"] },
            "description": "Confirma que a imagem chegou no storage e troca a thumbnail do vídeo (409 se o objeto não existir; 422 se o vídeo não estiver READY)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "12. Vídeos relacionados (sugestões)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('lista de sugestões (publicados + PUBLIC, sem o próprio vídeo)', () => {",
                  "  const items = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(items).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  items.forEach(v => {",
                  "    pm.expect(v.visibility).to.eql('PUBLIC');",
                  "    pm.expect(v.publishedAt).to.not.eql(null);",
                  "    pm.expect(v.slug).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('slug'));",
                  "    pm.expect(v.views).to.be.at.least(0);",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}/related?limit=10", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}", "related"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "10" }] },
            "description": "Sugestões da página de visualização: mesma categoria, publicados + PUBLIC, sem o próprio vídeo, mais recentes primeiro (limit padrão 10, máx 20). Vídeo sem categoria → últimos publicados da plataforma."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HLS",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Master playlist",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('playlist HLS com renditions', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('#EXTM3U');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('/hls/');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}/hls/master.m3u8", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}", "hls", "master.m3u8"] },
            "description": "Playlist master do vídeo (só vídeos processados após a Fase 09 — 'hlsUrl' no Get info indica). CONTA UMA VIEW quando publicado. As linhas de rendition apontam de volta para a API. Vídeo sem HLS: 404 (use /stream)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Playlist da rendition (ex.: 480p)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('segmentos presignados', () => pm.response.text().includes('X-Amz-Signature'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{slug}}/hls/480p/playlist.m3u8", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{slug}}", "hls", "480p", "playlist.m3u8"] },
            "description": "Playlist de uma qualidade com cada segmento reescrito para URL presignada (TTL 6h — um filme longo toca até o fim). NÃO conta view (só a master conta). Rendition fora da escada do vídeo: 404."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload multipart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Iniciar multipart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('videoId', b.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('slug', b.slug);",
                  "pm.test('partSizeBytes e totalParts', () => b.partSizeBytes > 0 && b.totalParts > 0);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Vídeo grande\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 20971520,\n  \"contentType\": \"video/mp4\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/multipart", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "multipart"] },
            "description": "Cria o vídeo (rascunho) e abre a sessão multipart. O servidor dita o partSizeBytes (padrão 8 MiB); fatie o arquivo nesse tamanho (última parte = resto). Mesmas validações do upload simples."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. URLs das partes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                  "pm.test('URL com contentLength por parte', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.json().forEach(p => pm.expect(p.contentLengthBytes).to.be.above(0));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"partNumbers\": [1, 2, 3]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/parts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "videos", "{{videoId}}", "parts"] },
            "description": "URLs presignadas das partes pedidas (máx. 100 por chamada; 1..totalParts). RE-EMISSÍVEIS: parte falhou ou URL expirou (TTL 1h), peça de novo só aquela. Faça o PUT de cada fatia na URL correspondente com Content-Type do vídeo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Status das partes (resume)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
